{"id":"610497","name":"腐竹韭菜馅饼","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/610497/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"腐竹","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"50°，120克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"温水合成一个偏软一点的面团，醒面30分钟。","img":"images/610497/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉馅放蚝油、生抽、姜、葱油拌匀腌制20分钟。","img":"images/610497/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"韭菜、腐竹洗净准备好。","img":"images/610497/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"全部切好放入肉馅碗里。","img":"images/610497/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放盐、芝麻油拌匀备用。","img":"images/610497/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面团不用揉，分成均匀的剂子，用手按扁。","img":"images/610497/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入馅料。","img":"images/610497/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"收口继续醒10分钟。","img":"images/610497/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"馅饼按扁，按薄一点。","img":"images/610497/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅内放油烧热，放入馅饼小火慢慢煎。","img":"images/610497/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"中间反几次面。","img":"images/610497/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"馅饼熟透。","img":"images/610497/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅装盘。","img":"images/610497/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"又香又软，好吃极了。","img":"images/610497/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}